    "media:imagetext": "FROM:\nVirginia Y. Black\nPublic and Community Relations Director\nLOS ANGELES DEPARTMENT OF AIRPORTS\n#1 World Way - Los Angeles\n90009\nTelephone: (213) 646-5260\nTHE NEW LAX: Three years of intense construction activity at\nLos Angeles International Airport culminated in June with completion of\nthe new Tom Bradley International Terminal, the horizonally-oriented\nstructure near the top of the photo. Other major projects now\noperational include domestic Terminal 1, the T-shaped facility at center\nright, and the airport's second level roadway, which separates vehicular\ntrafic of arriving and departing passengers. Several airlines have\nremodeled existing terminals. The $700 million construction program\nwas\nfunded from airport and airline revenues.\n# # #\nLN: rh\n7/2/84\n#31945Y2\nz1shb\\8",
